<section class="page-our-story-section" style="padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--bg-cream);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Behind the Blooms</span>
    <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: 3.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      From Fresh Petals to Timeless Keepsakes
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;">
      WrapUpBlooms began with a simple belief: that the beauty of a flower shouldn't wilt in a week, and that the gifts we carry every day should hold deep personal meaning.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Narrative Section -->
  <div class="container" style="margin-bottom: 5rem;">
    <div style="background: #FFF; padding: 3.5rem; border-radius: 32px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
        <div>
          <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Our Heritage</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.25;">
            Crafting Tangible Reminders of Love & Friendship
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            When we first launched WrapUpBlooms on Etsy, we noticed that while people love fresh floral bouquets, what they truly yearn for is something permanent &mdash; a pocket mirror that lights up during an intimate wedding rehearsal, a leather lipstick sleeve clipped to an everyday handbag, or an engraved wooden family puzzle resting on the living room mantle.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
            By merging botanical birth month illustrations with permanent precision laser engraving, we turned everyday functional accessories into cherished keepsakes. Over 12,400 customers later, our mission remains unchanged: handcrafting every piece with patience, care, and heartfelt devotion.
          </p>
          <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-primary"><span>Contact Us Now to Get Your Mirror</span></a>
        </div>

        <div style="position: relative; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);">
          <img src="{{ 'story-artisan-craft.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Artisan Studio Workshop" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;">
          <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; right: 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); padding: 18px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate);">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 0.95rem;">Small Batch &bull; Individually Inspected</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Every piece hand-cleaned and polished before packaging.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Shop Members & Production Partners Section -->
  <div class="container" style="margin-bottom: 5rem;">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Our People & Partners</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Team Behind WrapUpBlooms</h2>
      <p>The dedicated creators, crafters, and laser engraving masters bringing your custom visions to life.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <!-- Saddam -->
      <div style="background: #FFF; border-radius: 28px; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg-petal); color: var(--primary-rose); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700;">
            S
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin: 0;">Saddam</h3>
            <span style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">Designer, Owner, Curator</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Saddam is the visionary behind WrapUpBlooms. From initial botanical line-drawing drafts to selecting premium vegan leathers and metallic hardware, he curates each collection to balance timeless aesthetic elegance with everyday durability.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-delicate); padding-top: 10px;">
          🌸 Specialty: Floral Typography & Product Architecture
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Naina -->
      <div style="background: #FFF; border-radius: 28px; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg-petal); color: var(--primary-rose); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700;">
            N
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin: 0;">Naina</h3>
            <span style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">Designer, Crafter, Customer Service</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Naina oversees hands-on craftsmanship, intricate embellishments, and personalized customer care. Whether a customer is arranging custom bridesmaid sets or requesting urgent turnaround for an upcoming baby shower, Naina ensures every request is met with warmth and perfection.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-delicate); padding-top: 10px;">
          ✨ Specialty: Hand Assembly, Gift Packaging & Client Relations
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Engraving Shop -->
      <div style="background: #FFF; border-radius: 28px; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg-blush); color: var(--accent-gold); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.75rem;">
            ⚙️
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin: 0;">Engraving Shop</h3>
            <span style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-dark-rose); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">Production Partner &bull; NH, United States</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          A skilled craftsman and trusted partner who handles the physical engraving and localized dispatch for our US-bound orders. Operating out of New Hampshire, they utilize calibrated industrial fiber lasers to render razor-sharp botanical engravings on all metallic and leather surfaces.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-delicate); padding-top: 10px;">
          🇺🇸 Location: New Hampshire, USA &bull; 1-2 Day Dispatch
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5-Step Creation Process -->
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Behind the Scenes</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Our 5-Step Artisan Process</h2>
      <p>From your custom order to her hands, here is how we ensure each gift is flawless.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #FFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); line-height: 1;">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;">Botanical Drafting & Personalization Proof</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Your recipient's name and selected birth month flower are matched against our curated vector typography to ensure harmonious proportions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #FFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); line-height: 1;">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;">Precision Laser Etching</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Executed by our trusted New Hampshire production partner with microscopic laser passes that etch cleanly into leather or metallic compact surfaces.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #FFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); line-height: 1;">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;">Hand Cleaning & Mirror Calibration</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Every mirror and casing is manually inspected for optical clarity, LED halo battery charge, and seam alignment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #FFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); line-height: 1;">04</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;">Boutique Ribbon Gift Boxing</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Nestled into our signature pink and cream presentation box, hand-tied with double-faced satin ribbon and an embossed botanical care card.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #FFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-rose); line-height: 1;">05</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;">Fast Localized US Dispatch</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Carefully packaged in protective mailers and dispatched in 1-2 business days with full door-to-door tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3.5rem;">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 16px 36px;">
        <span>Contact Us Now to Get Your Mirror</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
